{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53477","headline":"题京兆大兴善寺释南素院 · 玄幽","name":"题京兆大兴善寺释南素院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三万莲经三十春，半生不踏院门尘。\n（见《宋高僧传》卷二五。\n又见《酉阳杂俎续集》卷五）（按：《全唐诗》卷八五一录二句，仅题作《逸句》，作者亦缺事迹，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"玄幽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53477.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53477","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}